      <title>AI编程助手为何浪费一半上下文窗口？三个技巧让它不再‘失忆’</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai002/post/20260823/AI%E7%BC%96%E7%A8%8B%E5%8A%A9%E6%89%8B%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E6%B5%AA%E8%B4%B9%E4%B8%80%E5%8D%8A%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%87%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%AA%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7%E8%AE%A9%E5%AE%83%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E5%A4%B1%E5%BF%86/</link>
